-# =============================================================================
-# tools/diagnostics.jl -- consolidated ConstructionBots diagnostics / compare / fixture driver.
-#
-# Every standalone tools/{diag_*,run_*_check,ood_compare_*,ab_*,dump_*}.jl script is now a
